{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Exit code 1\n\\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{2}{Overview. A randomized assignment on a network yields exposure features (own treatment, neighbour-treated fraction or count, optional two-hop and degree terms); a fitted outcome regression is evaluated at the observed assignment and at the all-treated and all-control corners, and the average difference is the GATE estimate. The eight-case grid varies graph family, response shape, spillover range, strength and assignment design. Error can come from sampling noise or from misspecification of the exposure mapping, which matters most at the rarely observed corners}{figure.caption.4}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:cases}{{1}{4}{Eight-case grid and frozen-estimator error on the 24 unseen seeds (relative RMSE per case). Each factor contrast in the text is a single case pair}{table.caption.9}{}}\n\\newlabel{fig:main}{{2}{5}{Final plane, 24 unseen seeds. (a) Mean relative RMSE over the eight cases for the oracle, the frozen estimator, linear exposure regression, difference-in-means (DiM) and neighbourhood HT (log axis). (b) Frozen-estimator relative RMSE per case; dashed lines are the oracle and linear plane means. Per-case values for the reference estimators are not available}{figure.caption.14}{}}\n\\newlabel{fig:rel}{{3}{6}{(a) Per-seed mean relative error over the eight cases for the 24 final seeds, with the mean and a 95\\% percentile-bootstrap interval for the mean (10{,}000 resamples over seeds). (b) Mean 95\\%-interval coverage over cases against the nominal level, with mean relative interval width}{figure.caption.15}{}}\n\\newlabel{bodyend}{{6}{8}{Conclusion}{section.6}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:spec}{{2}{11}{Case specifications (all cases: $n=3000$, $\\sigma =1$, intercept 1, $\\beta =(0.8,-0.5)$, $\\tau _0=1$, $\\tau _1=0.5$)}{table.caption.19}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:seeds}{{3}{12}{Final per-seed mean relative error over the eight cases (seeds 9001--9024)}{table.caption.23}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:controls}{{4}{12}{Final-plane validity checks for the frozen estimator}{table.caption.24}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:search}{{5}{12}{Model-selection plane (8 seeds): relative RMSE per case, plane mean, absolute bias and coverage}{table.caption.25}{}}","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_014gedpgwWPrNQGR89Lx63Fo"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"96cff137-170e-47bc-8fe8-44e05d15df83","uuid":"86f4015c-56fa-4d99-8eca-56eeee82731c","timestamp":"2026-11-11T08:25:33.232Z","tool_use_result":"Error: Exit code 1\n\\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{2}{Overview. A randomized assignment on a network yields exposure features (own treatment, neighbour-treated fraction or count, optional two-hop and degree terms); a fitted outcome regression is evaluated at the observed assignment and at the all-treated and all-control corners, and the average difference is the GATE estimate. The eight-case grid varies graph family, response shape, spillover range, strength and assignment design. Error can come from sampling noise or from misspecification of the exposure mapping, which matters most at the rarely observed corners}{figure.caption.4}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:cases}{{1}{4}{Eight-case grid and frozen-estimator error on the 24 unseen seeds (relative RMSE per case). Each factor contrast in the text is a single case pair}{table.caption.9}{}}\n\\newlabel{fig:main}{{2}{5}{Final plane, 24 unseen seeds. (a) Mean relative RMSE over the eight cases for the oracle, the frozen estimator, linear exposure regression, difference-in-means (DiM) and neighbourhood HT (log axis). (b) Frozen-estimator relative RMSE per case; dashed lines are the oracle and linear plane means. Per-case values for the reference estimators are not available}{figure.caption.14}{}}\n\\newlabel{fig:rel}{{3}{6}{(a) Per-seed mean relative error over the eight cases for the 24 final seeds, with the mean and a 95\\% percentile-bootstrap interval for the mean (10{,}000 resamples over seeds). (b) Mean 95\\%-interval coverage over cases against the nominal level, with mean relative interval width}{figure.caption.15}{}}\n\\newlabel{bodyend}{{6}{8}{Conclusion}{section.6}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:spec}{{2}{11}{Case specifications (all cases: $n=3000$, $\\sigma =1$, intercept 1, $\\beta =(0.8,-0.5)$, $\\tau _0=1$, $\\tau _1=0.5$)}{table.caption.19}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:seeds}{{3}{12}{Final per-seed mean relative error over the eight cases (seeds 9001--9024)}{table.caption.23}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:controls}{{4}{12}{Final-plane validity checks for the frozen estimator}{table.caption.24}{}}\n\\newlabel{tab:search}{{5}{12}{Model-selection plane (8 seeds): relative RMSE per case, plane mean, absolute bias and coverage}{table.caption.25}{}}"}
