{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvpuBhQPRCb4CpfH1HDC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W16i8LPyR5uoWb886LTMon","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/paper; python3 - <<'E'\ns=open('paper.tex').read()\na=\"The two-hop case stayed at 0.445 under both linear-based estimators and the library on the model-selection plane, and at 0.452 on the final plane.\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,\"The two-hop case stayed at 0.445 under both the linear-plus-correction estimator and the library on the model-selection plane (0.428 for the flexible ensemble), and the library scored 0.452 on the final plane.\")\nopen('paper.tex','w').write(s)\nimport json\nc=json.load(open('claims_grounding.json'))\nfor x in c['claims']:\n    x['claim']=x['claim'].replace(\"case 8 0.445 for all linear-based estimators and the library\",\"case 8 0.445 for linear plus correction and the library (0.428 flexible ensemble)\")\njson.dump(c,open('claims_grounding.json','w'),indent=1)\nE\npython3 .claude/skills/write-paper-standalone/scripts/validate_claims.py --paper-data paper_data.json --references references_provenance.json --bib references.bib --claims claims_grounding.json --paper-dir . | tail -2; bash .claude/skills/scientific-evidence/scripts/scientific_evidence.sh verify --root-dir . | tail -1; bash $TMPDIR/build.sh\nls global_memory/ | head -3; cat >> memory.md <<'E'\n\n### 2026-11-11 | step=paper\n- Wrote paper.tex (ICLR, anonymous), claims_grounding.json (18 claims), figure_manifest.json (4 figures; overview_schematic placeholder awaiting orchestrator render), build_figures.py (Figs 2-4 + derived_stats.json), search_plane_metrics/ (copies of three metrics.json files, needed because evidence verifier does not follow the results symlink).\n- Framing: thesis-first characterization (exposure-mapping fidelity governs error); rejected estimator-wins and chronology framings. Final outcome qualified; disclosed shared case specs, no gate ablation, two-hop cause unknown, undercoverage 0.839 cause unestablished.\n- References: replaced noisy bib with 28 topical entries (11 retained from original retrieval, 17 added via OpenAlex, provenance merged); irrelevant medical/climate entries dropped. Cited only by title/topic where papers were not read.\n- Claim fixes: per-seed score is mean relative error (0.102), distinct from RMSE aggregate (0.126); case 8 search value 0.445 attributed only to linear+correction and library (ensemble 0.428).\n- Verification: validate_claims OK; scientific-evidence 0 dangling; compile via pdflatex OK (body 9 pages, last page ~75% with placeholder overview); pdftotext absent so full compile script/validators could not run locally.\nE\ncp memory.md /dev/null; cat >> global_memory/memory.md <<'E'\n\n### 2026-11-11 | step=paper\n- Paper drafted (ICLR, thesis: exposure-mapping fidelity governs regression-GATE error; final qualified, 0.126 vs linear 0.180). claims_grounding.json and scientific-evidence consistent with grounded inputs (0 dangling). Refs pruned/extended to 28 topical entries.\nE\necho '{\"scope\":\"paper\",\"step\":\"paper\",\"summary\":\"Paper drafted and validated locally: claims OK, 0 dangling evidence refs; 28 topical references; overview figure awaits orchestrator render.\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-11T08:30:00Z\"}' >> global_memory/memory.jsonl"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":981,"cache_read_input_tokens":211141,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":981},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"96cff137-170e-47bc-8fe8-44e05d15df83","uuid":"e8b035ac-d103-4ae1-9c30-611137ecd37b","timestamp":"2026-11-11T08:29:46.2